{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ab800fc720a9a09b","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"decoder_type\": \"dense (Qwen3_5, VL-wrapped ckpt -> serve text-only with --language-model-only)\",\n  \"attention\": \"hybrid GDN linear_attention + full_attention (1 of every 4 layers), GQA 24Q/4KV\",\n  \"layer_mix\": \"64 layers: 48 linear-attn (GDN) + 16 full-attn, full_attention_interval=4\",\n  \"kv_cache_per_token\": \"small (only 1/4 layers hold KV); block_size forced to ~848 tokens by mamba/GDN page alignment\",\n  \"active_params\": \"27B total\",\n  \"num_experts\": 0,\n  \"experts_per_tok\": 0,\n  \"mtp\": \"not built into 0.28.0+rocm723 here; fused_gdn_decode_post_conv_mtp falls back to Triton GDN (verified non-bottleneck)\",\n  \"norm\": \"rmsnorm\",\n  \"notes\": \"gfx90a/MI250X PLATFORM LAWS (measured on this box, 2026-09, see /home/qiba/ai docs): (1) AITER INT8 a8w8 ScaledMM LINEAR is VALIDATED and FAST on gfx90a - VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1 + VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_LINEAR=1 select AiterInt8ScaledMMLinearKernel; 'not found tuned config in a8w8_tuned_gemm.csv -> default' is CORRECT behavior, do not chase tuned tables. (2) AITER fused-MoE is DEAD on gfx90a (CK 2-stage bf16 stage2 silently writes zeros; CDNA2 lacks global_atomic_pk_add_bf16). Never propose enabling aiter MoE. Triton fused MoE is optimal for MoE models. (3) FP8/FP4 compute physically absent (no FP8 ALU). fp8-KV storage is UNRELIABLE on 0.28.0+rocm723 (silent fallback/crash) - do not propose --kv-cache-dtype fp8. (4) NEVER enable custom allreduce (use_custom_allreduce) on gfx90a: silently corrupts output ('!!!'). Keep PYNCCL. (5) MoE/INT8 tuned-config seed tables measured WORSE than defaults on this box (A/B) - do not propose them as wins. (6) INT8 and BF16 have equal peak (181) on CDNA2; a8w8 wins via scheduling maturity (~2.9x vs Triton INT8). (7) --safetensors-load-strategy eager is REQUIRED here (loader silently dies without it on this storage). (8) Speculative decoding (dflash) tokens/step is a function of prompt style: random-token benchmark corpora collapse acceptance; measured random-prompt numbers CANNOT judge spec-decode levers. (9) Random-token Magpie corpus IS valid for GEMM/config/graph levers. (10) One MI250X die == one MI210 (gfx90a/104CU/64GiB): INT8 W8A8 27B single-die BF16-out serving hits ~80 tok/s single-stream WITH dflash on natural prose, ~50-65 without; TP=1 preferred for 27B-class weights (no cross-die comm).\"\n}\n=== manifest ===\n{\n  \"claw_session_id\": null,\n  \"code_revision\": \"\",\n  \"created_at_utc\": \"2026-09-14T13:49:02+00:00\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"inferencex\": {\n      \"commit\": \"3d55815\",\n      \"path\": \"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/.cache/InferenceX@3d5581562f643f9bdeb8410cd924e2c70906c966\",\n      \"remote\": \"https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX.git\"\n    },\n    \"magpie\": {\n      \"commit\": \"\",\n      \"path\": \"/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages\",\n      \"remote\": \"\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"ep\": 1,\n  \"framework\": \"vllm\",\n  \"gfx_arch\": \"gfx90a\",\n  \"gpu_specialist_capacity\": 2,\n  \"gpu_type\": \"\",\n  \"graph_mode\": null,\n  \"host\": \"amd-server\",\n  \"image\": \"rocm-ai/vllm:0.28.0-rocm7.2.4\",\n  \"kb_degraded_reason\": null,\n  \"max_minutes\": 180,\n  \"model_name\": \"Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8\",\n  \"model_path\": \"/mnt/stripe-3mix-3t2/models/davetha/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8\",\n  \"objective\": {\n    \"kind\": \"gain_pct\",\n    \"value\": 30.0\n  },\n  \"pid\": 7219,\n  \"pr_degraded_reason\": \"ir3_auto\",\n  \"reference_script\": null,\n  \"research_lane_capacity\": 4,\n  \"sandbox_user_id\": null,\n  \"schema_version\": 4,\n  \"server_args\": [\n    \"--trust-remote-code\",\n    \"--language-model-only\",\n    \"--quantization\",\n    \"compressed-tensors\",\n    \"--safetensors-load-strategy\",\n    \"eager\",\n    \"--compilation-config\",\n    \"{\\\"cudagraph_mode\\\":\\\"FULL_DECOD